<title>USA: California Jockey &quot;confident&quot; about vote.</title>
<headline>California Jockey &quot;confident&quot; about vote.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>California Jockey Club said on Friday that its proxy solicitors have advised the company that it is confident that the incumbent nominees have retained a majority on the board.</p>
<p>Final results of the proxy vote that was held today are expected to be available within 10 days, California Jockey said.</p>
<p>A shareholders committee had nominated a slate of five candidates for election to the company's board.</p>
</text>
